  "details": "For the new UI interface changes\n1. The Avatar selection interface is quite inconvenient for users with a large number of creations. Only a small list of drag-and-drop interfaces makes it impossible to switch Avatars more conveniently.\n2. It is recommended to add the HUD size modification of the UI interface, and the social options are reduced, but it is not convenient for players to view\n3. For the volume setting, please display the Avatar sound setting. In public occasions, most Avatars can set an extremely large animation sound range. It will be troublesome if you can’t turn off the animation sound before you don’t know which player is playing it.",
